      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/r/76d3ee/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2017-06-24T12:45:50.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Hello, I was able to re-download season 1 and 2.&nbsp;</p><p>The problem is... It happened several times. The progress was for example at 67%, 68%, 69% and then it startet again at 0%, 1%, 2% and switched back to 70%, 71% and so on. It finished and still downloaded again with up to 2 or 3 different progress.</p><p>If I check the size of the app for my iPad Air 2 the following is displayed: 6,39 GB!!!</p><p>Could somebody check their size for the app if he/she also uses iOS?</p><p>Maybe I could reinstall the app but I do not want to lose my achievements. I am no expert, I never did it.</p><p>If I click in the settings of the iPad on the app, 5,57 GB are documents and data for the app.</p><p>I am sure before the update it was like 2 Gb overall for the app, I am not sure.</p><p>Has somebody any hints for me?</p><p>PS. English isn't my mother tongue, I hope that I could depict the problem properly.&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>AN ADDITIONAL INFORMATION: All the content wasn't locked anymore but the game still downloaded both seasons again and again.&nbsp;</p>",
