      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/r/76d3ee/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2017-06-24T13:09:00.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Thank you for the answer. As already said, before the update it was also like 2 GB for me.&nbsp;</p><p>The \"documents and data\" part of the app is very big now if I check it in the settings of the iPad.</p><p>My assumption is that if I delete it altogether with the whole app my whole achievements will be lost...</p>",
