      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/migrantp/{size}/1921_2.png",
      "created_at": "2017-06-24T13:13:18.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>If you delete the app your achievements will not be lost, but you would lose your Weekly One-Shot collection (unless you backup and restore your device).</p><p>The extra data is most likely marked as a temporary file and something iOS will automatically delete when needed. So I wouldn't worry about it unless it stays for a long time.</p>",
