      "id": 199593,
      "name": "bolnerap",
      "username": "bolnerap",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/bolnerap/{size}/6056_2.png",
      "created_at": "2017-06-24T14:44:00.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I had a similar issue. I got an error this morning telling me my 64 GB iPad was low on space, and when I checked, SOTM was listed as being 5+ GB. I went back in and did the download process again, and the file size decreased to where it was supposed to be.</p><p>Last night when I tried the download process, the season 1 and season 2 passes kept fluctuating wildly on the progress bar. When I did it again this morning, it was much more smooth. Perhaps there was still some weirdness on Apple's end as the kinks got worked out?</p><p>In any case, I did not need to delete and recover the app - simply redownloading the expansions did the trick.</p>",
      "post_number": 5,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T05:27:43.019Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
