      "read": false,
      "user_title": "",
      "bookmarked": false,
      "raw": "<p>I had a similar issue. I got an error this morning telling me my 64 GB iPad was low on space, and when I checked, SOTM was listed as being 5+ GB. I went back in and did the download process again, and the file size decreased to where it was supposed to be.</p><p>Last night when I tried the download process, the season 1 and season 2 passes kept fluctuating wildly on the progress bar. When I did it again this morning, it was much more smooth. Perhaps there was still some weirdness on Apple&#39;s end as the kinks got worked out?</p><p>In any case, I did not need to delete and recover the app - simply redownloading the expansions did the trick.</p>",
